    {
      "original": "Navigating reliability, resilience, and market complexities demands innovative technologies",
      "replacement": "Addressing reliability, resilience, and market complexities requires advanced technologies",
      "reason": "Replaces the banned metaphorical verb \"Navigating\" and the banned adjective \"innovative\" (Prefer other words)."
