      "reason": "Replaces \"profound,\" which leans toward the banned intensifiers/academic tells, with a more precise term."
    },
    {
      "original": "Ice storms still take lines out of service for days—planners rewrite protection settings the next week they also file new interconnection studies.",
      "replacement": "Ice storms still take lines out of service for days; planners rewrite protection settings the next week and also file new interconnection studies.",
